<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Point Blank RAPID</Major>
    <Description>Point Blank Macro no recoil works most of the "SMG" guns, but not applicable to all ASSAULT RIFLES. Put the macro to your left mouse click and adjust the operation mode. Hope you enjoy this macro, much better you use T77. The screen resolution is 1920 x 1080 by 60 fps</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 14 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 16 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 14 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 16 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 14 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 16 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 14 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 16 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Point blank</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>